@startuml
!include style.iuml
top to bottom direction
hide empty members
class "Game presenter" as game <<ví dụ>>
interface IAdsService <<interface>>
class AdsService {
 - provider : IAdsProvider
 + InitializeAsync(...)
 + ShowAsync(...)
 + Tick()
}
interface IAdsProvider <<interface>>
class AdsKitProvider {
 + InitializeAsync(...)
 + Load(...)
 + Show(...)
}
class "VoxelBusters AdsManager" as sdk <<vendor>>
game -down-> IAdsService : dependency truyền vào
AdsService -up..|> IAdsService
AdsService -down-> IAdsProvider : provider reference
AdsKitProvider -up..|> IAdsProvider
AdsKitProvider -down..> sdk : API / callback adapter
note right of AdsService
Contracts / Runtime không tham chiếu SDK.
Realization: nét đứt + tam giác rỗng.
end note
@enduml
